[I] Adaptive Entropy Coding library

[T] libaec provides fast lossless compression of 1 to 32 bit wide signed or
[T] unsigned integer samples using the CCSDS Adaptive Entropy Coding
[T] algorithm. It achieves best results for low entropy data such as space
[T] imaging instrument data or weather and climate model output and includes
[T] a replacement for the SZIP library.

[U] https://gitlab.dkrz.de/k202009/libaec

[A] Libaec Authors
